    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Recompute tumor-like-structure incidence and effect sizes for Xrel3 and Gli1 embryos with remote Kv1.5 expression versus oncogene-only controls. Suppression for both oncogenes near the reported magnitudes supports non-specificity to one oncogene.";
